{"extensions":{"textual":{"edition_statement":"Early Christian Writings digital edition","expressions":["mw:expression:christianity:early-writings:grc"]}},"id":"mw:edition:christianity:early-writings:standard","kind":"textual.edition","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"textual":{"language":"grc","script":"Grek","work":"mw:work:christianity:early-writings"}},"id":"mw:expression:christianity:early-writings:grc","kind":"textual.expression","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"en","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1","text":"There are two ways, one of life and one of death, but a great difference between the two ways."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"grc","representation":"source","script":"Grek","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1","text":"Ὁδοὶ δύο εἰσί, μία τῆς ζωῆς καὶ μία τοῦ θανάτου, διαφορὰ δὲ πολλὴ μεταξὺ τῶν δύο ὁδῶν."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1:grc","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"id","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1","text":"Ada dua jalan, satu jalan kehidupan dan satu jalan kematian, namun terdapat perbedaan besar di antara kedua jalan tersebut."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:christianity:early-writings","sequence":1,"unit":"section"}},"id":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:didache-1-1","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Didache 1:1 (The Two Ways)"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"en","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed","text":"I believe in God, the Father almighty, creator of heaven and earth. I believe in Jesus Christ, his only Son, our Lord..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"grc","representation":"source","script":"Grek","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed","text":"Credo in Deum Patrem omnipotentem, Creatorem caeli et terrae. Et in Iesum Christum, Filium eius unicum, Dominum nostrum..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed:grc","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"id","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed","text":"Aku percaya kepada Allah Bapa Yang Mahakuasa, Khalik langit dan bumi. Dan kepada Yesus Kristus, Anak-Nya yang tunggal, Tuhan kita..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:christianity:early-writings","sequence":2,"unit":"section"}},"id":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:apostles-creed","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Apostles’ Creed / Pengakuan Iman Rasuli"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"en","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed","text":"We believe in one God, the Father Almighty, Maker of heaven and earth, and of all things visible and invisible. And in one Lord Jesus Christ..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"grc","representation":"source","script":"Grek","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed","text":"Πιστεύομεν εἰς ἕνα Θεόν, Πατέρα Παντοκράτορα, ποιητὴν οὐρανοῦ καὶ γῆς, ὁρατῶν τε πάντων καὶ ἀοράτων. Καὶ εἰς ἕνα Κύριον Ἰησοῦν Χριστόν..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed:grc","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:christianity:early-writings-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:christianity:early-writings"},"textual":{"language":"id","representation":"source","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed","text":"Kami percaya kepada satu Allah, Bapa Yang Mahakuasa, Pencipta langit dan bumi, segala yang kelihatan dan yang tidak kelihatan. Dan kepada satu Tuhan, Yesus Kristus..."}},"id":"mw:content:christianity:early-writings:nicene-creed:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
